"archive; comicapi (and every other reader we're aware of) only looks there. "
"Some real-world .cbz releases package it one folder down instead, so their "
"title/series/author/publisher never get picked up. When enabled, ingest "
"rewrites a copy of the archive with ComicInfo.xml moved to the root before "
"it's imported — only when it's present but misplaced, never touching an "
"already-correct file. Zip-based archives (.cbz) only; .cbr/.cb7/.cbt are not "
"zip containers and are left as-is. Your original download is never modified, "
"only the copy that gets imported."
